\**{c=red:Note:}** This Quest is flagged upon completion of the previous Quest, {q:Drafted by the Duchy|Drafted by the Duchy|Drafted by the Duchy}.
=2 Walkthrough
* Engage in and complete the 6 **Tier I** {p:Voidwatch} battles in the 3 field areas surrounding {p:Jeuno} (present and past):
** __{m:Cherufe}__ - {z:Batallia Downs} (G-8), (I-9), (J-10).
** __{m:Taweret}__ - {z:Batallia Downs (S)}. (G-8), (I-9), (J-10).
*** Fastest access is via {z:Batallia Downs (S)} {p:Survival Guide} warp which will take you very close to the (G-8) VW spawn located between the "o" and "v" of **Coveffe Barrows** on the map.
** __{m:Yatagarasu}__ - {z:Rolanberry Fields} (E-10), (F-8), (G-7).
*** Fastest Access is via {z:Rolanberry Fields} {p:Survival Guide} warp, which puts you just north of the (G-7) VW spawn located at the NW corner of the grid cell.
** __{m:Agathos}__ - {z:Rolanberry Fields (S)} (E-10), (F-8), (G-7).
*** Fastest Access is via {z:Rolanberry Fields} {p:Survival Guide} warp + Cavernous Maw, which puts you just north of the (G-7) VW spawn located at the NW corner of the grid cell.
** __{m:Goji}__ - {z:Sauromugue Champaign} (G-6), (I-6), (K-10).
** __{m:Gugalanna}__ - {z:Sauromugue Champaign (S)} (G-6), (I-6), (K-10).
*** Fastest access is via {z:Sauromugue Champaign (S)} {p:Survival Guide} warp which puts you in (K-10) and VW spawn is near the NE corner of the grid.
* Once all 6 are defeated, return to an {p:Atmacite Refiner} to have your {@k} {k:White stratum abyssite} examined and upgraded to {@k} {k:White stratum abyssite II}.
** It is not required to return to a Refiner after each battle, only once all 6 are completed.

----
* Engage in and complete the 6 **Tier II** {p:Voidwatch} battles in the 3 dungeons entered from the areas surrounding {p:Jeuno} (present and past):
** __{m:Gasha}__ - {z:The Eldieme Necropolis} Map 2: (J-6), (J-10), (L-9).
** __{m:Giltine}__ - {z:The Eldieme Necropolis (S)} Map 2: (J-6), (J-10), (L-9).
** __{m:Mellonia}__ - {z:Crawlers' Nest} Map 2: (F-6), (F-8), (I-7).
** __{m:Nympha Eunomia}__ / __{m:Kalos Eunomia}__ - {z:Crawlers' Nest (S)} Map 2: (F-6), (F-8), (I-7).
** __{m:Roly-Poly}__ - {z:Garlaige Citadel} Map 1: (G-9), (H-7) Map 2: (G-8).
** __{m:Laidly Laurence}__ - {z:Garlaige Citadel (S)} Map 1: (G-9), (H-7) Map 2: (G-8).
* Once all 6 are defeated, speak with any {p:Voidwatch Officer}, past or present, to receive a brief cutscene and {@k} {k:Voidwatch alarum}.
** The named {p:Officers|Voidwatch Officer} present in Zilart/Promathia/Aht Urghan zones will not begin this cutscene.
* Return to the **Audience Chamber** in {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} for a cutscene and to receive the {@k} {k:White stratum abyssite III} and {@k} {k:Voidwatcher's emblem: Qufim}.
** **(Optional-ish)**: Return to the **Bulwark Gate** in {z:Sauromugue Champaign (S)} at (F-6) to receive a cutscene and 30,000 {p:Gil}.
*** **{c=red:Note:}** This must be done before beginning the Quest {q:A World in Flux|A World in Flux|A World in Flux} if you plan on continuing this storyline.
*** Just do this step now instead of waiting. It might take longer to complete during a later Quest.

